# rosa

--- Rosa_BushControl | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_ROSA_BUSH_CONTROL_DESC
raw  All opponents hiding in bushes take <!card.character.weaponskill.damage.scaleaccessoryvalue3.scaletolevel> damage and get slowed down for <!card.accessory.statuseffectenemy.duration.ticksasseconds> seconds.
now  All opponents hiding in bushes take 300 damage and get slowed down for 3 seconds.
  card.character.weaponskill.damage.scaleaccessoryvalue3.scaletolevel  300  -> 300
  card.accessory.statuseffectenemy.duration.ticksasseconds  3  -> 3

--- Rosa_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_HEAL_FOREST_DESC
raw  Rosa recovers <VALUE1> health per second when inside a bush.
now  Rosa recovers 4 health per second when inside a bush.
  VALUE1  4  -> 540

--- Rosa_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_DAMAGE_BUFF_SUPER_DESC
